{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Immerse yourself in the world of Ancient China and build your dream cities on one of the hand-crafted maps. It will sit where stunning nature and fantastical setting mix with urban planning. Watch the season change as your settlement grows from a few buildings with peasants to a bustling city worthy of the Emperor's visit. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >After your appointment as the Governor of this land, people\u2019s lives are in your hands. You must fulfill the Emperor\u2019s wish and bring prosperity to the city. Making decisions is no funny business; as there are more people, your citizens' needs grow bigger. As the governor, you must deliver their requests or face unhappy residents.  </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u3164<br>\u3164</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u3164</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1330430/extras/85663a2f929e2ef557e2ab98602ee212.avif?t=1770900164\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1330430/extras_big/85663a2f929e2ef557e2ab98602ee212.webp?t=1770900164 width=1560 height=111 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Create efficient production chains and provide for your city. The infrastructure prepared for your city will run everything smoothly. Seek out perfect spots to extract natural resources and place your food production on the ideal plot of land. If you succeed in planning everything out, even the most catastrophic weather conditions and harshest winters won\u2019t be able to destroy your city.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1330430/extras/353645dca17451426475a993d7ec9c20.poster.avif?t=1770900164\" width=1170 height=494 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1330430/extras/353645dca17451426475a993d7ec9c20.webm?t=1770900164\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1330430/extras/353645dca17451426475a993d7ec9c20.mp4?t=1770900164\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u3164</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1330430/extras/6afbcda67ab3faa0f902c48ce16f4e6f.avif?t=1770900164\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1330430/extras_big/6afbcda67ab3faa0f902c48ce16f4e6f.webp?t=1770900164 width=1560 height=111 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The Emperor's blessing allows you to join the trade routes and cooperate with other settlements for resources and materials. You can send out caravans and trade with friendly cities around you.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1330430/extras/e5bbca5611c435da48732fd7505cd136.poster.avif?t=1770900164\" width=1170 height=494 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1330430/extras/e5bbca5611c435da48732fd7505cd136.webm?t=1770900164\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1330430/extras/e5bbca5611c435da48732fd7505cd136.mp4?t=1770900164\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u3164</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1330430/extras/28b4e7300ae7609a933a543eb33783c7.avif?t=1770900164\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1330430/extras_big/28b4e7300ae7609a933a543eb33783c7.webp?t=1770900164 width=1560 height=111 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Worshiping the right gods is always a tricky business, so building positive relationships with all of them may benefit your citizens. Gods' blessings and miracles are powerful gifts that will help your cities grow bigger.  </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Unfortunately, the supernatural has a darker side, demons bring sorrow and fear into the hearts of your citizens.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1330430/extras/7d405d18b50f04ad3e392806e318694a.poster.avif?t=1770900164\" width=1170 height=494 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1330430/extras/7d405d18b50f04ad3e392806e318694a.webm?t=1770900164\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1330430/extras/7d405d18b50f04ad3e392806e318694a.mp4?t=1770900164\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u3164</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u3164</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\">  <span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1330430/extras/666dbe4aedc97e091bff034ff2482071.avif?t=1770900164\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1330430/extras_big/666dbe4aedc97e091bff034ff2482071.webp?t=1770900164 width=1560 height=111 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The greatness is built stone by stone and brick by brick, one new building at a time. Research new technologies, advancing through multiple tiers that offer new opportunities. Upgrade your housing, fulfill the needs of your citizens and watch as they grow from simple peasants to respected craftsmen, scholars and lavish representatives of the upper class. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1330430/extras/c73e6367f31b817903455e1e700e41b3.poster.avif?t=1770900164\" width=1170 height=494 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1330430/extras/c73e6367f31b817903455e1e700e41b3.webm?t=1770900164\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1330430/extras/c73e6367f31b817903455e1e700e41b3.mp4?t=1770900164\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u3164</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Jump into the beautiful world of Celestial Empire! Plan, develop, and grow magnificent cities, which will bring your pride and joy on every stage of your governing journeys.</p>","achievements":{"highlighted":[{"name":"Winter Defeated","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/1330430/42a00792cd49647e98ff04d8657561f2af93bf92.jpg"},{"name":"To the Heavens","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/1330430/eb6deb536e246e6750061736c5df55c4131378e2.jpg"},{"name":"Aim Higher","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/1330430/86ec2be62867b881118595116162888c191a9648.jpg"},{"name":"The Art of Craft","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/1330430/e0cb4e58318c62c6da68a29e3d0e7a719bc4dffc.jpg"},{"name":"A Wise Man Once Said\u2026","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/1330430/47fb1c4ce4eee726b4bb54f4596834e5a362558d.jpg"},{"name":"Emperor\u2019s Inner Circle","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/1330430/1b820841c7e7b83baaf8817adf86131a04cab50d.jpg"},{"name":"Taking It Easy","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/1330430/5ea10abe3ad891c2797aeeafbafb0689456fb02b.jpg"},{"name":"Promise Fulfilled","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/1330430/aae5ea18291867cc6ea0d0068b4a44d47d9cdff8.jpg"},{"name":"Up For The Challenge","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/1330430/ab2eeb6f4524bd090004fcf0f9bfad39cdb5ffdd.jpg"},{"name":"The Legend of Tianxia","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/1330430/9a88b8ee81426f11f32433e1e078aad1f7987ab3.jpg"}],"total":19},"background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/1330430?t=1770900164","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1330430/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1770900164","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1330430/4afc9778b697e291037d9951d65d5e7d17535d97/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1770900164","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1330430/4afc9778b697e291037d9951d65d5e7d17535d97/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1770900164","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Steam Achievements","id":22},{"description":"Custom Volume Controls","id":68},{"description":"Adjustable Difficulty","id":78},{"description":"Playable without Timed Input","id":74},{"description":"Save Anytime","id":79},{"description":"Stereo Sound","id":69},{"description":"Surround Sound","id":70},{"description":"Steam Cloud","id":23},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"detailed_description":"<h1>Update Roadmap</h1><p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1330430/extras/2b6e7834aeb2d51b444a3c4ce0ea4323.avif?t=1770900164\" width=1560 height=878 /></span></p></p><br><h1>About the Game</h1><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Immerse yourself in the world of Ancient China and build your dream cities on one of the hand-crafted maps. It will sit where stunning nature and fantastical setting mix with urban planning. Watch the season change as your settlement grows from a few buildings with peasants to a bustling city worthy of the Emperor's visit. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >After your appointment as the Governor of this land, people\u2019s lives are in your hands. You must fulfill the Emperor\u2019s wish and bring prosperity to the city. Making decisions is no funny business; as there are more people, your citizens' needs grow bigger. As the governor, you must deliver their requests or face unhappy residents.  </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u3164<br>\u3164</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u3164</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1330430/extras/85663a2f929e2ef557e2ab98602ee212.avif?t=1770900164\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1330430/extras_big/85663a2f929e2ef557e2ab98602ee212.webp?t=1770900164 width=1560 height=111 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Create efficient production chains and provide for your city. The infrastructure prepared for your city will run everything smoothly. Seek out perfect spots to extract natural resources and place your food production on the ideal plot of land. If you succeed in planning everything out, even the most catastrophic weather conditions and harshest winters won\u2019t be able to destroy your city.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1330430/extras/353645dca17451426475a993d7ec9c20.poster.avif?t=1770900164\" width=1170 height=494 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1330430/extras/353645dca17451426475a993d7ec9c20.webm?t=1770900164\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1330430/extras/353645dca17451426475a993d7ec9c20.mp4?t=1770900164\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u3164</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1330430/extras/6afbcda67ab3faa0f902c48ce16f4e6f.avif?t=1770900164\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1330430/extras_big/6afbcda67ab3faa0f902c48ce16f4e6f.webp?t=1770900164 width=1560 height=111 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The Emperor's blessing allows you to join the trade routes and cooperate with other settlements for resources and materials. You can send out caravans and trade with friendly cities around you.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1330430/extras/e5bbca5611c435da48732fd7505cd136.poster.avif?t=1770900164\" width=1170 height=494 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1330430/extras/e5bbca5611c435da48732fd7505cd136.webm?t=1770900164\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1330430/extras/e5bbca5611c435da48732fd7505cd136.mp4?t=1770900164\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u3164</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1330430/extras/28b4e7300ae7609a933a543eb33783c7.avif?t=1770900164\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1330430/extras_big/28b4e7300ae7609a933a543eb33783c7.webp?t=1770900164 width=1560 height=111 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Worshiping the right gods is always a tricky business, so building positive relationships with all of them may benefit your citizens. Gods' blessings and miracles are powerful gifts that will help your cities grow bigger.  </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Unfortunately, the supernatural has a darker side, demons bring sorrow and fear into the hearts of your citizens.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1330430/extras/7d405d18b50f04ad3e392806e318694a.poster.avif?t=1770900164\" width=1170 height=494 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1330430/extras/7d405d18b50f04ad3e392806e318694a.webm?t=1770900164\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1330430/extras/7d405d18b50f04ad3e392806e318694a.mp4?t=1770900164\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u3164</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u3164</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\">  <span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1330430/extras/666dbe4aedc97e091bff034ff2482071.avif?t=1770900164\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1330430/extras_big/666dbe4aedc97e091bff034ff2482071.webp?t=1770900164 width=1560 height=111 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The greatness is built stone by stone and brick by brick, one new building at a time. Research new technologies, advancing through multiple tiers that offer new opportunities. Upgrade your housing, fulfill the needs of your citizens and watch as they grow from simple peasants to respected craftsmen, scholars and lavish representatives of the upper class. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1330430/extras/c73e6367f31b817903455e1e700e41b3.poster.avif?t=1770900164\" width=1170 height=494 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1330430/extras/c73e6367f31b817903455e1e700e41b3.webm?t=1770900164\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1330430/extras/c73e6367f31b817903455e1e700e41b3.mp4?t=1770900164\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u3164</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Jump into the beautiful world of Celestial Empire! Plan, develop, and grow magnificent cities, which will bring your pride and joy on every stage of your governing journeys.</p>","developers":["President Studio"],"dlc":[3992290],"genres":[{"description":"Simulation","id":"28"},{"description":"Strategy","id":"2"},{"description":"Early Access","id":"70"}],"header_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1330430/header.jpg?t=1770900164","is_free":false,"linux_requirements":{"minimum":"<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>","recommended":"<strong>Recommended:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>"},"mac_requirements":{"minimum":"<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>","recommended":"<strong>Recommended:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>"},"movies":[{"das